      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sulphur_Springs%2C_Texas",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Sulphur Springs Library, housed at 611 N., serves as a hub for local history and genealogy research.",
